{"4164770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silent Cold: The Lost Expedition", "steam_appid": 4164770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.poster.avif?t=1772385282\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.webm?t=1772385282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.mp4?t=1772385282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren is an investigator and a member of a four-person team sent on an expedition to recover documents from a research laboratory in the Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, before reaching the runway, the plane carrying them suffered an engine failure and crashed. Lauren was the only survivor, rescued by an unknown android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren’s Objective:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations to recover the research journals and find a way to escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique melee combat system has been developed to make every encounter intense and dangerous — even the simplest zombies now pose a serious threat. Combat takes place at close range, offering a classic, skill-based experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Cold: The Lost Expedition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person zombie survival game where your mission is to collect information from a secret research base in Antarctica conducting advanced experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use melee weapons for close combat and powerful firearms to eliminate zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items and clothing — change outfits to alter Lauren’s appearance.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.poster.avif?t=1772385282\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.webm?t=1772385282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/extras/a5252f548724eb29fb3ec4596d914978.mp4?t=1772385282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren is an investigator and a member of a four-person team sent on an expedition to recover documents from a research laboratory in the Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, before reaching the runway, the plane carrying them suffered an engine failure and crashed. Lauren was the only survivor, rescued by an unknown android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lauren’s Objective:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations to recover the research journals and find a way to escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique melee combat system has been developed to make every encounter intense and dangerous — even the simplest zombies now pose a serious threat. Combat takes place at close range, offering a classic, skill-based experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Cold: The Lost Expedition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person zombie survival game where your mission is to collect information from a secret research base in Antarctica conducting advanced experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use melee weapons for close combat and powerful firearms to eliminate zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover useful items and clothing — change outfits to alter Lauren’s appearance.</p>", "short_description": "Explore frozen and mysterious environments, uncover the lost research journals, and experience an engaging story. Fight bloodthirsty zombies or use stealth and agility to escape. Live through a tense and chilling adventure featuring a captivating heroine in a dark, frozen world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, French, Italian, German, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/75284120302ca0147c2b78516912d117e305fe7e/header.jpg?t=1772385282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/37f2c977d4cbf4c6fe2a1d802f1aaa5e6029a2b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772385282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164770/37f2c977d4cbf4c6fe2a1d802f1aaa5e6029a2b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772385282", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  WINDOWS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  WINDOWS 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st